<p class="p-header-above wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://yellow.ai/case-study/">Success Stories</a></p>



<h1 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>How Waste Connections Automated Customer Service for 250K+ Users Every Month While Saving ~$4M Annually</strong></h1>



<div class="wp-block-columns sec1-coll-left-inner is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
