</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<p class="p3 wp-block-paragraph">Use Cases</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>Automate waste pickup scheduling and service modifications</li>



<li>Enable billing inquiries and bill payments through self-service</li>



<li>Report missed pickups and place vacation holds</li>



<li>Provide 24/7 multilingual customer support across digital and voice channels</li>



<li>Transfer complex service requests to live agents</li>



<li>Collect customer feedback and generate service quality insights</li>
</ul>
