<section class="wp-block-group sec-3"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Overview</h2>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-css-opacity"/>



<p class="p1 wp-block-paragraph">Waste Connections is one of North America&#8217;s leading waste management companies, providing residential, commercial, and industrial waste collection services across the United States and Canada. As customer demand continued to grow, the company sought a scalable way to deliver faster, always-on customer support while improving operational efficiency.<br><br></p>



<p class="p1 wp-block-paragraph">To modernize its customer service operations, Waste Connections partnered with Yellow.ai to deploy <strong>Trina</strong>, a dynamic AI agent integrated across voice and digital channels. By automating routine customer interactions and providing multilingual 24/7 self-service, the organization improved customer experiences, reduced operational costs, and created a scalable support model capable of handling hundreds of thousands of customer interactions every month.</p>
</div></section>



<section id="challenge" class="wp-block-group sec-4"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Challenges</h2>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-css-opacity"/>



<p class="p2 wp-block-paragraph">With more than <strong>850,000 customer calls and website inquiries every month</strong>, Waste Connections needed a more efficient way to manage growing service demand while maintaining high customer satisfaction.<br></p>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
