<div class="wp-block-group"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<p class="p1 wp-block-paragraph"><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong>Managing high volumes of routine service requests</strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<p class="p3 wp-block-paragraph">Customers frequently contacted support for common requests such as pickup scheduling, missed pickup reporting, vacation holds, driver tracking, billing, and payments. These repetitive interactions consumed valuable agent capacity.<br></p>
</div></div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<div class="wp-block-group"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<p class="p1 wp-block-paragraph"><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong><strong>Delivering 24/7 customer support</strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></p>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<p class="p3 wp-block-paragraph">Customers expected assistance outside standard business hours, requiring an always-available support experience across voice and digital channels.<br></p>
</div></div>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1932" height="1290" loading="lazy" src="https://yellow.ai/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/neck-pain-call-center-burnout-with-woman-office-communication-consulting-customer-service-stress-headache-tired-with-employee-computer-hotline-help-desk-advisory-1.webp" alt="" class="wp-image-165170" srcset="https://yellow.ai/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/neck-pain-call-center-burnout-with-woman-office-communication-consulting-customer-service-stress-headache-tired-with-employee-computer-hotline-help-desk-advisory-1.webp 1932w, https://yellow.ai/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/neck-pain-call-center-burnout-with-woman-office-communication-consulting-customer-service-stress-headache-tired-with-employee-computer-hotline-help-desk-advisory-1-300x200.webp 300w, https://yellow.ai/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/neck-pain-call-center-burnout-with-woman-office-communication-consulting-customer-service-stress-headache-tired-with-employee-computer-hotline-help-desk-advisory-1-1024x684.webp 1024w, https://yellow.ai/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/neck-pain-call-center-burnout-with-woman-office-communication-consulting-customer-service-stress-headache-tired-with-employee-computer-hotline-help-desk-advisory-1-768x513.webp 768w, https://yellow.ai/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/neck-pain-call-center-burnout-with-woman-office-communication-consulting-customer-service-stress-headache-tired-with-employee-computer-hotline-help-desk-advisory-1-1536x1026.webp 1536w, https://yellow.ai/wp-content/uploads/2023/04/neck-pain-call-center-burnout-with-woman-office-communication-consulting-customer-service-stress-headache-tired-with-employee-computer-hotline-help-desk-advisory-1-150x100.webp 150w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1932px) 100vw, 1932px" /></figure>
